# Token Efficiency Rules
When executing shell/terminal commands to inspect files, searches, diffs, or tests, invoke RTK directly:
- Git: `rtk git status`, `rtk git diff`, `rtk git log -n 15`
- Files: `rtk read <file>`, `rtk grep "<query>"`, `rtk ls`
- Testing/Linting: `rtk pytest`, `rtk ruff check`
